<title>USA: USAir raises some domestic fares by 10 pct.</title>
<headline>USAir raises some domestic fares by 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USAir Group Inc said Wednesday that it will raise seven- and 14-day advance purchase fares on domestic travel by 10 percent starting in January.</p>
<p>&quot;This was a competitive response to other carriers increasing their fares,&quot; said USAir spokesman Dave Castelveter.</p>
<p>Castelveter said the rise does not apply to international or unrestricted fares including walk-up and full coach fares.</p>
</text>
